    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Colony Crafter</strong> is an openworld survival game on the moon. Play as an astronaut and prepare the moon for future colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig, collect and survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure your survival by collecting valuable minerals and raw materials. Craft the tools you need to complete your tasks. There are countless valuable resources to discover and collect, from which you can build tools, buildings and vehicles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/2c1a8a798e35e67d6e31c749b02bfedb.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/2c1a8a798e35e67d6e31c749b02bfedb.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/2c1a8a798e35e67d6e31c749b02bfedb.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use heavy machinery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many useful devices from old moon missions that you can use. You will find abandoned communication buildings, mines and much more where you can find important items and modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/974d9b2e7517a815fe245e25e67a0c09.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/974d9b2e7517a815fe245e25e67a0c09.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/974d9b2e7517a815fe245e25e67a0c09.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a huge moon map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large and freely accessible moon map on foot or with nuclear-powered vehicles. There are many interesting locations from former moon missions and wrecks to find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/b05e9d3af40cb9cb14e9c3a41eab0d87.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/b05e9d3af40cb9cb14e9c3a41eab0d87.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/b05e9d3af40cb9cb14e9c3a41eab0d87.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore procedurally generated caves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find procedurally generated cave systems with different resources and secrets under the moon. The deeper you go, the hotter it gets, so equip yourself well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/3b133f262eb495377a2149346db50430.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/3b133f262eb495377a2149346db50430.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/3b133f262eb495377a2149346db50430.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: pay attention to hunger, thirst, temperature and oxygen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world: you have the freedom to go anywhere on a huge moon map, even under the moon and into orbit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &amp; Craft: Many resources, items and building parts for different purposes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore: procedurally generated caves, asteroid impacts and more...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets: crashed satellites &amp; old moon bases could contain valuable resources and information from past missions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Colony Crafter</strong> is an openworld survival game on the moon. Play as an astronaut and prepare the moon for future colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig, collect and survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure your survival by collecting valuable minerals and raw materials. Craft the tools you need to complete your tasks. There are countless valuable resources to discover and collect, from which you can build tools, buildings and vehicles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/2c1a8a798e35e67d6e31c749b02bfedb.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/2c1a8a798e35e67d6e31c749b02bfedb.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/2c1a8a798e35e67d6e31c749b02bfedb.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use heavy machinery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many useful devices from old moon missions that you can use. You will find abandoned communication buildings, mines and much more where you can find important items and modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/974d9b2e7517a815fe245e25e67a0c09.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/974d9b2e7517a815fe245e25e67a0c09.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/974d9b2e7517a815fe245e25e67a0c09.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a huge moon map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large and freely accessible moon map on foot or with nuclear-powered vehicles. There are many interesting locations from former moon missions and wrecks to find. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/b05e9d3af40cb9cb14e9c3a41eab0d87.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/b05e9d3af40cb9cb14e9c3a41eab0d87.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/b05e9d3af40cb9cb14e9c3a41eab0d87.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore procedurally generated caves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find procedurally generated cave systems with different resources and secrets under the moon. The deeper you go, the hotter it gets, so equip yourself well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/3b133f262eb495377a2149346db50430.poster.avif?t=1749552065\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/3b133f262eb495377a2149346db50430.webm?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2625470/extras/3b133f262eb495377a2149346db50430.mp4?t=1749552065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: pay attention to hunger, thirst, temperature and oxygen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world: you have the freedom to go anywhere on a huge moon map, even under the moon and into orbit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect &amp; Craft: Many resources, items and building parts for different purposes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore: procedurally generated caves, asteroid impacts and more...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden secrets: crashed satellites &amp; old moon bases could contain valuable resources and information from past missions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
